      "timestamp_raw": "May 9, 2023 13:14:11 GMT -5",
      "body_html": "I thought there was a thread on this, and if there is, a homie for sure can't find it, so here's a new one!  <br/><br/>This is an absolutely incredible, jaw dropping variant with the best of both worlds: crystal clear veining on the outside that turns dark as the traps age coupled with an extreme red throat!  Easy to grow, vigorous, productive, and overall a looker!<br/><br/>Even as babies, they're pretty darn jaw dropping, here are some older photos from I think 2021 and 2022:<br/><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/51187673575_923b504b32_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/>The details of the veins is highly environmental.  When left undisturbed for a while, the venation becomes more pronounced:<br/><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/51210387339_c6e10dc060_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/>more pronounced like this!<br/><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/51338800555_2f259db88e_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><br/><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/52108968681_78e249cdf7_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><br/>YES!<br/><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/52108968076_d1c1c079ab_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/>Here are some new photos of this variant, pics taken 5/9/23:<br/><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/52884717353_fd68de9209_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/52883694722_40cda1a807_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/52884435284_16c7959b66_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/>",
      "body_text": "I thought there was a thread on this, and if there is, a homie for sure can't find it, so here's a new one!\nThis is an absolutely incredible, jaw dropping variant with the best of both worlds: crystal clear veining on the outside that turns dark as the traps age coupled with an extreme red throat!  Easy to grow, vigorous, productive, and overall a looker!\nEven as babies, they're pretty darn jaw dropping, here are some older photos from I think 2021 and 2022:\nThe details of the veins is highly environmental.  When left undisturbed for a while, the venation becomes more pronounced:\nmore pronounced like this!\nYES!\nHere are some new photos of this variant, pics taken 5/9/23:",
